2026-10-29 compatibility changes for Lean/Mathlib 4.35.0:
- Twenty-two source modules only; no CausalSmith pipeline, FoML, optlib, or
  upstream numerical-certificate package is included.
- Remove the unrelated BerryEsseenSmoothing import from PrawitzSpatialFourier.
- Extract its charFun_normal_quotient_intervalIntegrable theorem and proof
  verbatim into CharFunNormalQuotient; import this leaf in
  PrawitzSpectralIntegrability instead of the broad BerryEsseenSmoothing module.
- Add an explicit Mathlib.Analysis.PSeries import in
  ShiftedReciprocalSquareRegularity.
- Replace the unavailable measurable_id.abs proof term by the equivalent
  continuous_abs.measurable proof term in PrawitzSpectralIntegrability.
- Keep the original namespaces, definitions, theorem statements, and proofs
  except for that measurability API adaptation. Modified copies carry dated
  source notices. The extracted probe module has its final library name.

2026-10-29 probability-leaf addition:
- Add SymmetrizedThirdMoment.lean from the same pinned commit, byte-for-byte
  unchanged, to prove the actual independent-difference cubic moment bound.
  This leaf imports only Mathlib and adds no numerical-certificate package.

2026-10-29 characteristic-function damping additions:
- Add CosineCubic.lean and BerryEsseenWideCharFun.lean from the same pinned
  commit after byte-for-byte comparison with official raw source.
  BerryEsseenWideCharFun is unchanged. For Lean/Mathlib 4.35, CosineCubic
  adds only explicit Deriv.MeanValue and Deriv.Pow imports; its proof,
  fixed three rational Bernstein intervals, and coefficients are unchanged.
  No grid or certificate generator is added or run.
